Mutable Instruments' Braids, Plaits and stmlib -- Copyright 2012-2021 Emilie Gillet (emilie.o.gillet@gmail.com)

Vendored from https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack (braids/, plaits/) and https://github.com/pichenettes/stmlib
(only the files LXRXXL ZYNTH builds). Each file keeps its copyright notice. Changes made for LXRXXL ZYNTH, each marked
"LXRXXL ZYNTH" in the file:
  - plaits/dsp/dsp.h: the sample rate is 44.1 kHz (was 48 kHz, corrected to 47872.34 Hz for Plaits' hardware);
  - plaits/dsp/engine/wavetable_engine.cc: the wave map has room for all four banks.

